<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-slate-600">Resolved</span>
</div>
<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Server Capacity Bump</h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-3">
